      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the emotions part, but it feels like you're still being a bit vague. if these \"grievances\" are as legitimate as you say, wouldn't it be more accurate to say the mainstream media is actively working to delegitimize them because they threaten the status quo? is it just a \"gap\" in communication, or is there a more intentional effort to suppress these perspectives?",
